00:08:30,320 --> 00:08:39,360
on the level of external information that you\h
just pick and change at will.

73
00:08:39,360 --> 00:08:46,800
If you're not aware of where the craving is, on the\h
right level, in your own experience, whether you

74
00:08:46,800 --> 00:08:54,800
like it or not, you place the blame for the\h
suffering where it isn't. That will be inevitable.

75
00:08:54,800 --> 00:09:02,160
Yes. So then doesn't matter whether you blame the\h
fact that you're lonely or you blame the fact on that

76
00:09:02,160 --> 00:09:09,600
I'm not free from X fetter, which is why this is\h
still here. Or, you know, it's because I was

77
00:09:09,600 --> 00:09:15,200
born like this, or my upbringing was like that, or\h
because yesterday I did this unwholesome thing.

78
00:09:15,200 --> 00:09:23,360
But no. The thing is, as the Buddha said,
the dhamma is timeless. So it's right here and now.

79
00:09:23,360 --> 00:09:28,240
It's the attitude that you have towards what\h
has arisen right here and now. That's where the

80
00:09:28,240 --> 00:09:35,600
problem is, and that's what you would become able\h
to see if you have removed all these obstructions

81
00:09:36,720 --> 00:09:44,240
of your behavior and then you're basically, as\h
he would say, delving with the knife to uncover

82
00:09:44,240 --> 00:09:54,080
Where is that craving? Where does it arise, and to\h
what extent is this... what level of input do

83
00:09:54,080 --> 00:10:00,560
I have in it? Because it's not that it's there on its own,
that you're fully subjected to it;

84
00:10:00,560 --> 00:10:06,640
you're maintaining it. And you also have to get to\h
understand what it is that maintains it, which is

85
00:10:06,640 --> 00:10:10,546
what the Buddha would call the unwholesome\hactions.

86
00:10:14,012 --> 00:10:24,880
That's where you would develop that completely universal\h
and incapable of being doubted standard of what is

87
00:10:24,880 --> 00:10:33,600
beneficial and what is unbeneficial. Because now\h
you have dug up that thing that was there all\halong,

88
00:10:33,600 --> 00:10:40,800
but because you were so distracted\h
by other things that felt much more natural,

89
00:10:40,800 --> 00:10:47,600
you didn't see it and you didn't take it as your\h
actual reference point. But now that you see it,

90
00:10:47,600 --> 00:10:55,440
it becomes completely obvious that anything else\h
except this cannot be a right guidance for

91
00:10:55,440 --> 00:11:00,800
wholesome and unwholesome. That's not where the\h
origin of suffering is. No. So any emphasizing

92
00:11:00,800 --> 00:11:06,720
anything else will be hit or miss, will be kind\h
of depending on the day, depending on the weather,

93
00:11:06,720 --> 00:11:13,200
depending on the hour of the day, maybe it\h
will have an influence of this internal animal,

94
00:11:13,200 --> 00:11:19,360
the citta, maybe it won't. Maybe it will make it\h
worse. And that's what most people's practice of

95
00:11:19,360 --> 00:11:25,120
the Buddhist teaching revolves around.\h
It's pretty much like, probabilistically they might

96
00:11:25,120 --> 00:11:32,000
be able to escape the suffering or not. But\h
yes, if you see that on the right level,

97
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:39,200
see the citta, see that indirect attitude, you could\h
call it the root attitude that's being exhibited

98
00:11:39,200 --> 00:11:47,360
towards sights, sounds, smells, taste, touches,\h
even thoughts, no matter how lofty, how kind of

99
00:11:47,360 --> 00:11:54,000
grandiose and important and even thoughts\h
about dhamma, like the most justified things that

100
00:11:54,000 --> 00:12:01,440
might come up. Well, the attitude behind that\h
is where the citta is, and your view of

101
00:12:01,440 --> 00:12:08,080
what is wholesome and unwholesome would be 
in\hrelation to that attitude. So the attitude needs

102
00:12:08,080 --> 00:12:13,600
purification. Yes. So then you would realize\h
in that sense there is no right object.

103
00:12:13,600 --> 00:12:20,560
There's no right kind of thing that you can land on\h
without questioning your attitude behind it.

104
00:12:20,560 --> 00:12:26,080
Yes. Just as sensuality is a man's intention.\h
That's the same principle.

105
00:12:26,080 --> 00:12:34,080
Yes, so greed, aversion, and delusion is your intention\h
completely. So then if you think that you can pick

106
00:12:34,080 --> 00:12:43,920
a safe kind of pasture where you do not 
have to question your motivation for

107
00:12:43,920 --> 00:12:49,760
being there and letting your attention\h
land there, that means you completely are not

