00:12:49,760 --> 00:12:55,920
seeing the reference point, because the reference\h
point would be: Why? Why am I allowing my attention

109
00:12:55,920 --> 00:13:03,680
to land on this sight, sound, smell, taste, touch\h
or even mental image, as complex and and intricate

110
00:13:03,680 --> 00:13:11,520
as it might be, there's always this peripheral\h
attitude in regard to that thing where you would

111
00:13:11,520 --> 00:13:20,480
have the passionate obsession, the doubt, the\h
the kind of obsessive doubt, that just keeps

112
00:13:20,480 --> 00:13:25,760
kind of revolving around the thing, even though\h
you already know the answer, but it just

113
00:13:25,760 --> 00:13:32,880
wants that emotional gratification out of it. You\h
have all the five hindrances basically on that

114
00:13:32,880 --> 00:13:40,960
peripheral level that you absolutely will not see\h
for as long as you think that the object itself

115
00:13:40,960 --> 00:13:46,240
is the measure of wholesome and unwholesome.\h
Yes. And that is why the sense restraint is so

116
00:13:46,240 --> 00:13:53,040
important, because you are restraining dwelling way\h
too much on the external object, so to speak.

117
00:13:53,040 --> 00:13:58,400
Which also means that as long as this is not understood\h
nowhere in the world are you safe.

118
00:13:58,400 --> 00:14:02,960
You will be basically everywhere, even if you\h
go in a spaceship to another planet, you will

