00:15:25,120 --> 00:15:30,960
you wouldn't actually realize nibbāna. You would\h
be delighting and maintaining your existence,

131
00:15:30,960 --> 00:15:36,720
your being, your bhava, through that, because\h
it's not about the object, not even about the

