00:15:36,720 --> 00:15:43,440
experience and the the kind of content of it,
it's about: How is the animal relating to it?

133
00:15:43,440 --> 00:15:49,760
Yes. So on paper, somebody could come up with a\h
quite accurate description of what nibbāna is,

134
00:15:49,760 --> 00:15:54,480
but their background attitude towards it could still\h
be wrong, which means that it's not actually now

135
00:15:54,480 --> 00:16:00,640
the nibbāna. And even when they have it in their\h
own experience so to speak, through the

136
00:16:00,640 --> 00:16:07,120
universally correct development of virtue,
sense-restraint, renunciation, without which you will

137
00:16:07,120 --> 00:16:14,560
not even get to the point where you\h
could make that mistake, because you will not have

138
00:16:14,560 --> 00:16:26,320
realized the phenomenon of dispassion. 
There, in regard to that...

139
00:16:26,320 --> 00:16:33,600
Let's say you have a well established attitude of not 
inclining\htowards sensuality, of being dispassionate towards

140
00:16:33,600 --> 00:16:41,600
the world, recognizing the impermanence\h
of life and the uselessness of clinging to\hit,

141
00:16:41,600 --> 00:16:47,920
as many ascetics in the Buddha's time were\h
able to do, if you read some of those stories.

142
00:16:47,920 --> 00:16:54,160
But then in regard to that phenomenon, of what\h
they think is a pure mind, which compared to the

143
00:16:54,160 --> 00:17:02,160
average person factually would be, well, 
they don't\hsee their attitude in regard to that.

144
00:17:02,160 --> 00:17:07,920
They don't see to what extent they are dependent on that, 
to\hwhat extent they are taking that for granted and

145
00:17:07,920 --> 00:17:16,480
taking refuge in that. And then for that reason\h
alone, what they think is the root problem would

146
00:17:16,480 --> 00:17:24,240
be on the level of: not having this great\h
development – phenomenon – of dispassion that

147
00:17:24,240 --> 00:17:29,520
I have brought about. But that still fails to\h
arrive at the level where the problem is:

148
00:17:29,520 --> 00:17:36,480
Even in regard to this, what is my attitude?\h
But obviously that doesn't mean that you need

149
00:17:36,480 --> 00:17:43,920
to necessarily get to that level and then\h
kind of correct course. No, it's like,

150
00:17:43,920 --> 00:17:48,720
it's everywhere. It's now in regard to whatever\h
you're seeing, hearing, tasting, smelling,

151
00:17:48,720 --> 00:17:55,920
touching, thinking. There is some attitude there\h
that's kind of like, you could say it's independent

