00:20:10,560 --> 00:20:18,240
description of, let's say, where the mind is\h
to be found, or what we often call 'right level'.

172
00:20:18,240 --> 00:20:24,640
So it might be useful for people to also\h
recognize that explanations are one kind of talk,

